  << /ActualText (The Testing \046 Validation Engineer will be responsible for developing and executing structured test plans for electric motors and related systems across EV and industrial applications\056 The role includes homologation support\054 failure analysis\054 field validation\054 and contributing to product improvement through data\055driven testing\056)
